SPS-SQL: Shared-Policy Search for Efficient SQL Synthesis

The source distribution contains Alpha-SQL-derived prompt templates and database
schema formatting. Their original MIT license is preserved at
src/sps/prompts/ALPHA_SQL_LICENSE. SPS-SQL adds the final task-consistency prompt
and its search and post-correction implementation.

NVIDIA NeMo DataDesigner, Qwen base models, and official benchmark evaluators are
external dependencies with their own licenses. Download benchmark datasets and
base models from their respective providers.
